I am home in my apartment.
In the kitchen I make dinner.
I wash fresh vegetables.
I chop an onion on the cutting board.
I also cut two red tomatoes.
I take a pan.
On the stove I heat some oil.
I put the vegetables in the pan.
I fry the food.
It smells really good.
I put salt and pepper in the food.
The food is ready.
I take a plate.
I put the food on the plate.
I fetch a glass of water.
I sit down at the table.
I eat my dinner.
The food tastes lovely.
I enjoy a quiet meal.
